{
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AddictedEncounterHappy.BarnBottleMeeting": "You find Marble coming out of the barn, holding one of her bottles of milk. When she spots you, she hurries over and hands you the bottle. [say: I want to find something out. Can you drink from that bottle?] she asks. Do you drink it?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AddictedEncounterHappy.BedsideBookVisit": "You find Marble in her room, softly humming while reading a book on her bed. You walk up to her, and without looking away from her book she says, [say: I can smell your need, sweetie. Are you ready for your drink?] She sets the book down and turns to you, her hands under her breasts as she leans forward.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AddictedEncounterHappy.MidChoreHelpOffer": "You find Marble in the midst of one of her chores. She smiles at you and says that if you help her with her chores, she will give you a bottle of milk to soothe your nerves. Do you do it for the milk, Marble, or refuse?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AddictedEncounterHappy.MilkDrinkPrompt": "Will you drink her milk?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AddictionGiveIn.JigglingBreastDesire": "You can't bear to see her jiggling in front of you and yet be unable to drink from those delicious looking breasts. You break down and beg Marble to let you drink her milk. She can't stand seeing you like this and agrees with a sad look in her eyes. You waste no time in gulping down her milk and feel it fill you with new strength. When you finish, you look up at her with some milk still dripping from your face. You are met with a sad smile as she wipes your face off."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AddictionGiveIn.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AfterMarbleHelp.GrowingMilkThirst": "You find that the more time you spend being around Marble, the thirstier you grow for her milk. Finally, as the two of you are finishing, you are unable to take it any longer and beg Marble to let you drink her milk. After a moment, your words sink in and she blushes deeply. [say: Ok sweetie, since you helped me out and all, let's go back to my room.] You enter into her pleasant room once again. She invites you onto her lap and lets you start sucking at one of her nipples. The moment that wonderful taste meets your tongue, you start gulping down the milk without abandon. She sighs in pleasure in response. From time to time, Marble gets you to switch nipples, all the while gently stroking your head and occasionally scratching behind your ears.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AfterMarbleHelp.MilkThoughtDistraction": "While you're working, you are continually plagued by the thought of drinking from Marble's breasts, but you're able to keep those thoughts at bay and continue working normally.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AfterMarbleHelp.SatedPullBack": "Once you've had your fill, you pull back and the two of you smile at each other. [say: It's really nice for you isn't it sweetie? Nice for me too to have someone like you that can give a good suck on my sensitive nipples.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ApologizeToWalkingTitsIMEANMARBLE.AskedToSwitchBreast": "[pg]After several minutes, Marble puts her hand on your forehead, and gently asks you to take care of her other breast. You don't disappoint her, and deeply draw milk from the other nipple with just as much vigor as before."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ApologizeToWalkingTitsIMEANMARBLE.CaughtWithHandsUp": "Eventually you find Marble stopped, looking towards you with her hands in the air saying, [say: You caught me! Come here.] She beckons you towards her chest, and you don't make her wait."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ApologizeToWalkingTitsIMEANMARBLE.ChasingThroughCrops": "You give chase after the bovine woman, wandering around the many plants in search of the runaway. Her constant giggling makes sure you know you're going in the right direction, but sometimes she likes to double back or make false trails so the game is more interesting. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ApologizeToWalkingTitsIMEANMARBLE.DucksIntoGrainField": "[pg]Marble looks around before ducking inside the field of tall stalks of grain next to her. After a moment, you follow her into the crops that are waving in the breeze. Her trail through the many plants isn't that hard to follow, but from the sounds of the giggles up ahead, this has turned into a game."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ApologizeToWalkingTitsIMEANMARBLE.EasyCatchOffGuard": "It isn't too hard to figure out that Marble isn't really trying, and you easily catch her off guard on one of her double backs. She doesn't even notice you until you peek out from between the stalks next to her, reaching out and getting a handful of her backside. [say: Clever [boy]...] she says."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ApologizeToWalkingTitsIMEANMARBLE.ExpectedNursingOffer": "[pg]You knew she was going to get around to this, so you figure you might as well get it over with. It's not like they're not really nice breasts, after all... You lower your [face] to her nipple, and gently wrap your lips around it. Marble sighs contentedly as you do so, and starts to groan slightly in pleasure as the first of the milk leaks from her teats. You certainly can't argue with the taste, sweet and creamy, and start to down the delicious fluid with relish. Marble doesn't seem to mind at all; in fact, the sounds of her pleasure only increase."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ApologizeToWalkingTitsIMEANMARBLE.FinallyFedPullBack": "[pg]After another few minutes, you finally have drawn your fill, and pull back from Marble, as she looks down at you with a kindly and pleased face. [say: Thank you so much for that, sweetie. I can't possibly refuse your apology after that. You're welcome to come and visit me here on the farm any time.] The cow-girl gives you a peck on the check and redresses her bountiful bosoms - a small part of you is sad to see them go. She helps you to stand up and walks you back to the main barn, then returns to her chores."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ApologizeToWalkingTitsIMEANMARBLE.OffersBountifulBreasts": "[pg][say: Care to have some of my bountiful breasts, you sweet thing?] she says, smiling eagerly and presenting you with one of her half-inch long reddish nipples. You notice that each nipple has a sore-looking swollen ring around it, probably the source of Marble's discomfort."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ApologizeToWalkingTitsIMEANMARBLE.PulledOntoHerLap": "[pg]Marble pulls you to the ground, and you fall onto the lovely lady's lap. Before you can say anything, Marble shushes you with a finger to your lips. She pulls up her top, stopping for a moment and winking at you when she reveals underboob, then lets her nipples slip out."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ApologizeToWalkingTitsIMEANMARBLE.SeekingReconciliation": "Wanting to make up for before, you apologize for your behavior and ask Marble if there is a way you could make it up to her. She's pleasantly surprised by your answer, and after a few moments of contemplation says, [say: Well, all right then. My breasts are still a bit sore - after all, I have to milk them every day - so do you think you could give them that personal touch?] You figured she would ask this of you... quite the one-track mind."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ApologizeToWalkingTitsIMEANMARBLE.WaitingHandsRaised": "Eventually you find Marble stopped and waiting for you. She puts her hands in the air and says, [say: You caught me!] It's fairly clear she's given herself up, but when she folds her hands in front of her chest and presses her breasts together, then tells you to come over, you aren't complaining."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AshamedAddictionBegForIt.HorrorSnatchBottle": "You look at her in horror at the suggestion of wasting her delicious milk in such a way. You snatch the milk bottle and hold it tightly to your chest. You beg her not to talk about it like that and not to throw her milk away so easily. She seems to be even more upset by your declaration and grabs hold of your hands. Marble looks into your eyes for a moment and tells you that there is always hope to change before she runs off. You are left with the milk bottle, but you think that you can wait until later to drink it. It just felt right to make that bold declaration and it seems to have made you feel better, if only for now."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AshamedAddictionBlame.BlamingOutburst": "You decide to take out your anger at your current state on Marble and start yelling at her. As you wind down from your rant, you can see that her hands are shaking. Her voice cracks slightly as she says, [say: You're right... I have to take responsibility for what I did to you and make it better. Come to me when you need my milk, and I'll help you get rid of your addiction. Then I'll make sure no one gets addicted ever again.] Her face still cold, Marble turns and walks away. You feel a little relief after venting at her, but you know that you'll really want to drink her milk again before too long. It doesn't help that you feel sore after yelling at her like that."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AshamedAddictionComfort.RelievedEmbraceWarmth": "She pulls you into her chest and you feel relieved to see the Marble you know is still in there. You feel warm drops of water fall on your head and look up to find Marble crying fresh tears, but this time with a big smile on her face.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AshamedAddictionComfort.ShortBreathsCrying": "You hear her breath start to come in short breaths and look at her face to find Marble crying fresh tears, but this time with a big smile on her face.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AshamedAddictionComfort.SilentEmbrace": "You walk straight up to her and wrap your arms around her. She just stands there idly for a moment before embracing you back. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AshamedAddictionComfort.WhisperedThanks": "[say: Thank you, sweetie,] she whispers so softly that you almost don't hear it. Unfortunately, being so close to her starts to remind you of what you so desperately need. The moment feels somewhat ruined as you unsuccessfully try to hold back your shaking. She pulls back and looks you straight in the eye. [say: Don't worry sweetie, we'll find a way to make this better together,] she says, holding you tightly in her arms. You can tell she's putting on a brave face and you don't think she actually has any idea of what to do. [say: Come back when you start to feel a need for my milk again,]' she tells you as you leave, little hiccups accompanying her words, [say: We will get through this.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AtNightAskMarbleForSomeSexMaybe.AnnoyedBackOfHead": "see the annoyed back of her head. Oh right, she's probably not in the mood for this. You'll have to find another way of satisfying your needs tomorrow."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AtNightAskMarbleForSomeSexMaybe.FoolAroundAccepted": "gently ask her if she wants to fool around. After a moment you hear her breathe out and, with a lewd voice, she says, [say: I was worried you'd never ask, sweetie...]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AtNightAskMarbleForSomeSexMaybe.FoolAroundRefused": "gently ask her if she wants to fool around. After a moment you hear her breathe out and she says, [say: Sorry sweetie, I'm not feeling up to it right now.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.AtNightAskMarbleForSomeSexMaybe.TurnToFaceMarble": "You turn to face Marble, and "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.BreakUpWithMarble.ConfirmBreakup": "Are you sure you want to break up with Marble? You won't be able to get her back if you do so."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.CaressMarble.OfferGentleCaress": "You offer to gently rub her breasts, saying it should be a lot less painful than the milking machine's sucking. [say: Oh no,] she retorts, [say: nothing is more wonderful than being sucked, but right now I guess I could use a break and get a good rub.] You move around behind her and reach up under her arms, firmly grasping her breasts. She gasps sharply at first, but as you start to gently massage and caress them, she lets out a sigh and starts breathing deeply. You begin to feel milk leaking out onto your hands as you rub her. [say: This is nice,] she says, [say: not as good as being suckled, but nice.] After a few minutes of gently massaging her breasts, she pulls your hands off of them and turns to you. [say: Thanks,] she says, [say: I'm still a little sore, but thank you for your touch, sweetie. Feel free to come back later; I'll be happy to visit with you any time.] Just before you leave, you notice that Marble is rubbing her breasts the same way you were, a slight smile on her face."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.DefinitelyBreakUpWithWithMarble.ApproachForSpace": "You approach Marble and tell her that you need a bit of space and some time away from her. She freezes at your words, and asks you to repeat yourself. You do so and she nods, her face almost impassive. [saystart]I guess I'll go back to the farm. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.DefinitelyBreakUpWithWithMarble.CollectsThings": "[sayend] Marble collects her things"
