  "Scenes.Marblescene.DefinitelyBreakUpWithWithMarble.SeeYouForMilk": "I'll see you there when you need my milk, alright?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.DefinitelyBreakUpWithWithMarble.SeeYouLater": "I'll see you later then."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.DoNotWantMarbleAddiction.AddictionRefusalTears": "You tell her that you've realized that her milk is addictive and you can't afford to depend on it. Tears well up in her eyes and she breaks down. [say: I'm so sorry, I didn't know!] she says between sobs, [say: I guess I'm just another wretched creature of this world. I thought I was special, but it looks like I'm corrupt too...] She suddenly reaches out and hugs your head tightly to her chest as she rocks back and forth. After a few minutes she holds you out and looks into your eyes. [say: Please forgive me!] she says before jumping off her bed and running out the door. You spend some time looking around the farm for Marble, but you're unable to find her. You tell Whitney what happened, and she promises that as soon as she knows where Marble went, you'll be the first to know."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.DrinkMarbleMilk.EarScratchClause": " and occasionally scratching behind your ears"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.DrinkMarbleMilk.MilkEuphoriaExit": "After drinking Marble's milk, a feeling of euphoria spreads through you as you leave the farm in high spirits."
