  "Scenes.Marblescene.DrinkMarbleMilk.RoomBedLapInvite": "Beaming, Marble leads you back to her room and sits down on the bed. She invites you onto her lap and lets you start sucking at one of her nipples. The moment that wonderful taste meets your tongue, you start gulping down the milk with reckless abandon. She sighs in pleasure in response. From time to time, Marble gets you to switch nipples, all the while gently stroking your head"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.DrinkMarbleMilk.SatedPullBack": "Once you've had your fill, you pull back and the two of you smile at each other. [say: It's really nice for you isn't it sweetie? Nice for me too to have someone like you that can give a good suck on my itching nipples.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.DumpMarblesMilk.ExactWordsRepeat": "Holding the bottle in your hands, you repeat her words exactly. Her face falls more and more with each declaration. Finally and to your body's great distress, you upturn the bottle and poor out the contents onto the ground. As the last drop splashes into the dirt, you feel a small relief from the symptoms of your withdrawal. When you look back up, you find that Marble has vanished. It hurts you in both mind and body to see Marble suffer like that, but at least it will be a while before you need to do something like that again."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleAshamedAddiction.BarnTankFollow": "You find Marble walking out of the barn, a tank in her arms. You decide to follow her as she goes behind the barn. When you round the corner, you see her pouring the contents of the tank out onto the ground. You ask her what she's doing, [say: I'm getting rid of this corrupted milk,] she says in disgust. As you approach her, you recognize the smell of her milk and lick your lips unconsciously. [say: I make so much of it each day, I'm a monster,] she says coldly, [say: and I made you need it.] As the last of the milk splashes onto the ground, Marble looks towards you. Surprisingly, her face seems hard and cold. Do you blame her for what happened to you, or do you comfort her?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleAshamedAddiction.BookResearchVisit": "You find Marble reading a book in her room. As you enter, she tells you that she has been continuing with her research on the effects of addiction. She stands up in front of you and starts playing with her breasts. You quickly feel your desire for her milk intensifying. [say: Try to fight your need,] she tells you as she continues rubbing her chest. You oblige her and try your best, but it's a struggle you do not enjoy as your body feels like it's pulling itself apart from the strain. Do you fight off your need?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleAshamedAddiction.BottleOfferExit": "You find Marble as she exits the barn, holding a bottle of her milk. She looks at you and holds out the bottle. [say: Take this,] she tells you, [say: and say what a horrible thing it is. Say you wish you'd never tasted it before. Say it should never exist. Then dump that trash onto the dirt.] Her eyes start to tear up as she finishes the last part. You could do what she says to help beat your addiction, or refuse because you feel that saying such things would hurt her. Or you could just beg her not to waste the milk like that. What do you do?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring.BreastHugGreeting": "Marble gives her customary greeting of hugging you to her breast before telling you that she is off to get milked at the barn. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring.EagerForMilking": "[pg]It seems that she is looking forward to it and doesn't want to put it off to talk. She hurries off and you're left to look around some more."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring.EagerMilkAgreement": "You really want some of that milk and eagerly agree.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring.FarmPathMeeting": "While wandering around the farm, you meet the cow-girl Marble heading towards the barn. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring.FarmWorkHint": "[pg][b:Maybe if you got her to like you a little more while doing some work around the farm?]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring.MilkDrinkPrompt": "Do you drink her milk?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring.QuickGreetingExchange": "You exchange a quick greeting before Marble tells you that she is off to get milked at the barn. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring.SuckleOfferQuestion": "[pg][say: But, since you're here, maybe you could suckle me yourself?] she asks smiling.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring2.BedInvitationOffer": "[pg]After you finish talking, Marble gives you another intense look. [say: Sweetie, will you come into my bed again?] You can feel a tingle in your groin at the thought of having sex with her again."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring2.IntenseLookOffer": "[pg]As the two of you finish chatting, Marble gives you an intense look. [say: You know that I really like you right, sweetie? I'd like it if I can do something special with you,] she hesitates for a moment, [say: Will you come to my bed?]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring2.InterludeFarewell": "[pg]After the pleasant interlude to your quest, you bid farewell to the pretty cow-girl and return to your camp."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring2.InvitationPrompt": "[pg]Do you accept her invitation?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring2.InvitationPromptAgain": "[pg]Do you accept her invitation?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring2.MilkScentAttraction": "[pg]The entire time you spend talking, you find yourself oddly attracted to Marble's scent, especially when you get an odd whiff of her milk. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring2.PleasantMealChat": "She is happy to see you and treats you to a small meal while you have a pleasant chat. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring2.RoomEntryBreastHug": "As you step into her room, she eagerly rushes over and hugs you to her breast. [say: You're as cute as ever, sweetie!] "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring2.RoomVisitDecision": "You decide to pay Marble a visit at her room. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleExploring2.WorldDangersTalk": "While you talk mostly about unimportant things, there is some discussion about the world and the dangers within."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleInitially.CuteMilkInvitation": "She looks down at you with a smile and says [say: Aww, you're so cute! Did you come for my milk? I'm always happy to give it, but since I'm kinda sore right now, you'll have to be gentle. Okay little one?] She moves towards you and tries to pick you up."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleInitially.NameExchange": "[say: My name's Marble, what's yours?] she asks you. You introduce yourself and exchange a few pleasantries before she asks how she can help you. You tell her that you actually came to help her, explaining that Whitney said she could use a gentle touch. [say: Oh that would be nice,] she says. [say: Spending the night connected to the milking machine was a mistake, and now I need something gentle.] How will you help her?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleInitially.SearchingBarnRooms": "You walk in to Whitney's barn and head over to a series of small rooms for the cow-girls. You find Marble's room and knock on the door. A friendly earthy female voice calls out in response and invites you in. Inside is a rather pleasant little room. There are several shelves on the walls and a small sitting table in the corner with seating for two. A large portion of the room is dominated by a large bed, the owner filling most of it. Lastly, you notice a mini-dresser next to the bed. The room's owner looks over at you and starts, [say: Oh, I've never met you before.][pg]As she gets up, you are given a chance to get a good look at her. She is over six feet tall, with long brown hair tipped with two cow horns and a pair of cow ears in place of normal human ones. Rounding out her relatively unchanged face are a pair of deep, brown eyes. She is wearing only a short plain skirt, so you get a full frontal view of her two HH-cup assets. They look rather sore right now, with big red circles around her puffy nipples. Her hands and arms appear mostly human save for thick-looking nails. A soft 'clop' brings your eyes down to see that she is covered in thick, dark blond fur going from {0} to where a human's feet normally would be, in place of which are hooves. A cow tail with a bow tied on it swings between her legs.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleInitially.SouthernBelleSpotted": "While exploring at Whitney's farm, you run across the{0} southern belle almost immediately. She looks like she has a job for you.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.EncounterMarbleInitially.WhitneyExplainsSoreness": "Whitney tells you that one of her barn's residents, a cow-girl named Marble, is sore from overusing the milk machines. She asks you to go and give the cow-girl a gentler touch from a living being.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.ArousingDescriptionShare": "Well, you certainly gave an arousing description. I think I can share something in return."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.ArousingDescriptionShareAgain": "Well, you certainly gave an arousing description. I think I can share something in return."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.AskDogMorphOrigin": " [say: I've seen lots of dog-morphs before, are you from Barkersvile?]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.AskIfSheChanged": "[pg]You decide to ask her if she's changed since she left home. [say: Well, I guess I'm a lot more level-headed than I was before, and I'm able to control myself much better when someone refuses to drink my milk. It still makes me really mad inside, but I keep a lid on it.] She stops for a moment. [saystart]I'm also fairly good at hiding my feelings."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.AskLastJobTrouble": "You ask Marble if there was any trouble with that last job. She looks at you a bit embarrassed and admits that it wasn't the first time she'd been late to a job, and it wasn't that big of an issue. Still, she doesn't like to keep Whitney waiting. [say: Anyway, where were we?] the cow-girl asks. [say: Ah, yes.] Marble nods, and resumes talking about the other members of her family. [say: I'm the oldest of three siblings, sweetie. Or at least, the three kids that were there when I left home! I'm also the only one who had daddy's fur; my other two sisters were both black-and-white.] She pauses for a moment. [say: Ophelia was the next after me; she was a pretty quiet girl most of the time, but when she started talking about all the stories she read, she could talk more than any of us could handle!] She smiles at this. [say: I didn't really understand why she liked reading so much at the time, but now I can't find a better way to spend my time when I'm in my stall and hooked up to the milkers. It's really a nice set-up Whitney put in for me: a comfortable chair, a light, and an end table with an adjustable vacuum level dial.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.AsksHumanHeight": " [say: Are most of you this tall?]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.CentaursAreNomads": " [say: I've seen a few centaurs before, but they don't seem to have regular homes. They're nomads, wandering the plains. Are you the same?]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.ChangeToWeather": "[pg]Marble tries to change the subject by bringing up the weather, but this proves to be an exceedingly dull subject when sunny weather seems to be all you have. It does quickly turn into Marble talking about the somewhat more interesting irrigation set-up that Whitney uses to keep her plants watered. Eventually the two of you part ways, as you haven't got anything else really interesting that you want to talk about right now."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.ChuckleLateAdvice": "[pg]You give a small chuckle at the belated advice; it would have been useful earlier."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.ChuckleThenPause": "You chuckle and say that you hardly think of them with all the other fun things to think about. Then you pause and say that it is in the moments that you do think about them that keep you from forgetting who you once were."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.ConcludesPastRegrets": "[pg]Her expression changes and she concludes, [say: But that's enough talking about the past and old regrets for now.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.EndTalkForNow": "[pg]The two of you decide to end things at that for now; Marble seems a bit restless after discussing nursing so much and often caresses her sensitive breasts when she thinks you aren't looking. She's probably eager to get back in the milker."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.ExplainOnceHuman": "[pg]You start by explaining that you weren't born as what you appear to be; you were once a human. Marble is surprised by this, but when you start to explain how you came to be what you are, she stops you. [say: You don't need to tell me the power of some of the things in this world. Mommy taught me how to find LaBova if I ever lose a part of my bovinity,] she says, winking at you. [say: I don't know of anything that will give humanity though, so I can't really help you if you want to change back...] You tell her that's fine and that you'll look on your own if you need to do so. [say: Well then, where is your human home?] she asks."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.FoundTheOne": " But I think that I've found the one who will change that. Right sweetie?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.FoundWhatSheSought": " [say: Even though the start of the trip didn't turn out all that well, I think I found what I was looking for.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.GladToSeeKind": " [say: It's so nice to see another of my kind,] she tells you, [say: I haven't seen any since I left home. Where are you from?]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.HerEyesLightUp": " Her eyes light up. [say: Are they all as cute as you?]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.HidesInnerLonely": " I may not show it, but I'm actually really lonely on the inside."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.IdleChatThenPart": "[pg]You idly chat for a few more minutes before parting for the day."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.LeftMountainsSeeking": "[pg][say: I left the mountains behind not long after that. At the time, I thought that I needed to find someone smaller that wasn't going to give me much trouble. A few years later I chanced upon a nice-looking husky-dog boy named Ansgar. We actually got along really well, and he loved nursing me so much. Though, about a week into it, he just walked up to me and said that he couldn't nurse from me anymore. I was furious at him, and I just blew up in his face over his refusal. At the end of it all, his hands started shaking and he ran off.] She stops at this and says sadly, [say: I never saw him again.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.LeftNoNobleReason": "[pg][say: Like I said, I didn't leave for such a noble reason. I left because I felt that it was time for me to move on, and to find a mate of my own.] She stops for a moment, looking straight at you seriously."
