  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.NoticesDumbstruck": "[pg]Marble looks up to grin at you, and finally notices the dumbstruck look on your face. [say: Uh, sweetie, what is it?] You make absolutely sure that you heard her right when she said she was 11 years old last year. She nods, and asks you why you find that so odd. You can only shake your head and inform her that humans take about 18 to 25 years to fully mature. She laughs at this idea and says that she's been fully grown since she was 6; all the members of her race are that way - those she's met, anyway. Well, there isn't much else you can say to that."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.OnlyOtherHumanMet": " [say: The only other human I've ever met is that wandering trader Giacomo,] she tells you [say: but he doesn't really talk about himself. Maybe you could tell me about humans? I was wondering where they live and what kind of people they are.]"
