  "Scenes.Marblescene.ExtendedMurbelFarmTalkz.SmallTalkThenAsk": "After you've been talking about inconsequential things for a few minutes, Marble asks you, [say: Sweetie, do you ever miss your home? Do you ever wish you could be back with your parents?]"
