  "Scenes.Marblescene.GiveMarbleTheProBovas4Sho.DeepBreathLoveVow": "Marble takes a deep breath and says, [say: I'm doing this for you because I love you so much. Remember that, all right, sweetie?] The woman knocks back the contents of the bottle easily and braces herself for the impending changes. The first movement she makes is to scratch absently on her arm, but this quickly sets off a chain reaction of itching all over her body, <b>and her skin begins erupting in clumps of brown fur, eventually covering her entirely</b>."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.GiveMarbleTheProBovas4Sho.ItchyFurGrowsTaller": "[pg]Consumed with scratching her unaccustomedly itchy fur, she doesn't notice herself growing taller; <b>to your eyes, it looks like she's gained about 8 inches of height.</b>"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.GiveMarbleTheProBovas4Sho.NodDownAndGasp": "Marble nods and downs the contents. Nothing happens for a moment... then she gasps and grabs at her chest, stumbling forward slightly. The cow-girl straightens up and releases her grip, then pulls open her top to look at her breasts. <b>Each is now decorated with sets of four nipples, like the teats of a cow. She has also gained about 4 inches in height, judging against the backdrop of the camp.</b>"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.GiveMarbleTheProBovas4Sho.PainHandsOverFace": "[pg]The woman cries out in pain and claps her hands over her face, then turns away from you embarrassed, stumbling slightly as she does so. You reach out to her reflexively, but she turns back quickly, revealing the cause; <b>her face has elongated and re-formed itself into a cow-like muzzle!</b>"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.GiveMarbleTheProBovas4Sho.TestNewNipples": "[pg]Marble takes a few minutes to test her new nipples, squeezing them gently and sighing as dribbles of milk decorate her areolae in fours instead of one, then looks at you and says, [say: This isn't really so bad. Actually, it feels nice. If you find another dose, I'm willing to drink it - just to see what happens, of course.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.GiveMurbleProBova.HandProBovaFirst": "You hand Marble the bottle of ProBova. She considers it for a few moments before looking at you and saying, [say: Judging by the label, this is probably going to make me even more cowlike then I already am, sweetie. I'm not really opposed to the idea, but it will be permanent. Are you sure you want me to drink it?]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.GiveMurbleProBova.SecondProBovaBottle": "You hand Marble another bottle of the ProBova. She studies your face seriously for a few moments before saying, [say: Now, you're absolutely sure that you want me to drink this? Remember that whatever happens will likely be permanent.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.GotMilk.AskMilkBottle": "You ask Marble for a bottle of her milk, and she happily hands you one. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble1.DepartureRewardOffer": "When the two of you finish and you start to leave, Marble calls out to you, [say: Wait, let me give you something!] You turn and look back at her as she rushes up to you. Smiling brilliantly, the cow-girl hands you a bottle full of warm milk, [say: My gift to you for your help, fresh from the source,] she says, patting her sizable chest.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble1.HeavyCratesStruggle": "Unfortunately, the crates are quite heavy and you end up having to stick with small ones to keep up with Marble's pace. She doesn't appear to mind, just enjoying having someone to talk to while she works, even if it doesn't save her many trips.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble1.MatchedCrateEffort": "You put your back into the job and manage to match Marble in her efforts. She is really impressed with your strength, and together you can cut the number of trips needed in half.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble1.MesmerizingHipSway": "After a little while, you notice that Marble is walking with an almost mesmerizing sway in her hips as she carries the crates; it is rather hard to take your eyes off her. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble1.OutmatchedCrateHauling": "You try your best, but for every crate you carry, Marble caries three. She doesn't mind though, since you'll end up saving her a quarter of the trips she would have had to make.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble1.SurpassingMarbleStrength": "Marble may be strong, but you are stronger. She is amazed as you manage to take even more crates at a time than she can, only held back by the number you can balance. Thanks to your efforts, the chore only takes a third of the number of trips it normally would have taken.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble1.WhitneyHelpSuggestion": "[say: You know, Marble is moving some produce right now. How about you go help her out?] Whitney suggests. You agree to help the well-endowed cow-girl, and Whitney directs you to the storage shed. You arrive to find that Marble is quite busy carrying stacks of crates into the barn. She gives you a smile when she sees you and calls out, [say: Hey, sweetie! Nice to see you.] When you tell her you came to help her smile broadens. [say: Oh, I'd love to have some help. It'll save me some trips if you give me a hand,] she says happily before putting on a serious face and continuing, [say: but don't strain yourself sweetie, these are heavy. I don't want you to get hurt.] With that, you get to work with her.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble2.BreezyWeedHauling": "Weeding the field is a breeze for you, going fast enough that you're able to bring weeds to Marble faster than she can eat them. In the end, you do almost all the work yourself. She does reward you with a good view for your efforts.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble2.DepartureRewardOffer": "When the two of you finish and you start to leave, Marble calls out to you, [say: Wait, let me give you something!] You turn and look back at her as she rushes up to you. Smiling brilliantly, the cow-girl hands you a bottle full of warm milk, [say: My gift to you for your help, fresh from the source,] she says, patting her sizable chest.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble2.SpeedSurprisePout": "Moving quickly through the fields, you surprise Marble with your speed so much that she jokingly pouts that you're getting to all the tasty weeds before she has a chance to eat them. You still end up getting a few good views of her ass.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble2.WeedMunchingLead": "Even though Marble often stops to munch on a weed, she is still able to get more weeds then you do. Despite her size, she can move surprisingly fast. Regardless, she enjoys simply having you there while she works, and you get to enjoy the view.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble2.WeedingJobOffer": "[say: I've got it; you can help Marble do some weeding. She's in the field over there right now,] Whitney says, pointing to a nearby pasture. Nodding to her, you set off to help the pretty cow-girl with her chores. It takes you a while to find her, but you eventually find Marble bent over with her rump in the air. Once you get closer you realize that she is munching on a weed. [say: Oh!] she exclaims, noticing you. She hurriedly straightens up and looks around a little embarrassed. [say: Hi there sweetie, what are you doing here?] You explain that Whitney suggested you could help her with the weeding. [say: Oh!] she exclaims again, [say: I guess that would be nice, but don't stare at my bum too much while I'm eating, ok?] You agree and set to work.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble2.WeedingRearGlimpse": "You put in a good effort at cleaning out the weeds, and Marble often gives you a good look at her rear when she finds a tasty looking weed.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.HelpMarble2.WhitneyFarmEncounter": "You run into Whitney at the farm, and ask if there's something you could do.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.InteractWithMarbleAtCamp.AlchemistPurityQuestion": "[say: Hello, sweetie; have you had a chance to talk to that alchemist yet? I'm so close to being pure at last, but I need his help if I'm to get over this last hurdle.]"
