  "Scenes.Marblescene.KidsHaveRatPlaytime.GamesReachRathazul": "Your games take you around the camp until you come across Rathazul; smoke rises from his alchemy equipment as he works on another one of his concoctions. Curious, your [if(marbleMultiKids){children run|[if (marbleSoleBoy){son|daughter}] runs}] up to him to get a closer look at his work and ask him what he is doing."
