  "Scenes.Marblescene.KidsHaveRatPlaytime.RathazulExperience": "[pg]Rathazul's years of experience are made evident from the way he speaks of the basics of alchemy and how he applies them while he continues working on his potion, explaining the process in a simplified manner. [if (inte <= 30){Just like you, y|Y}]our "
