  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleAfterRapeBattle.SpotMarbleAtBarn": "While exploring the farm, you notice the cow-girl that hit you earlier, Marble, coming out of the barn. You could try confronting her if you want to, or you could just avoid her from now on."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleAfterRapeNo.LeaveNotWorthIt": "You shake your head. It's just not worth the headache to deal with this cow. You turn around and leave; you aren't going to be seeing her anymore."
