  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleAfterRapeYes.ApproachBarnSpotted": "Deciding to deal with her, you move towards the barn. However, Marble spots you on your way over and quickly disappears inside. Just as you get to the entrance, she re-emerges with a large two handed hammer in hand. [say: Leave right now, or this hammer is going into your head,] she tells you with an angry look in her eyes and drops into a combat stance. Will you fight her?"
