  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleBadEndFollowup.AbandonQuestToMilk": "You've abandoned your quest due to your inability to refuse Marble, thanks to the effect her milk has on you. However, you may have a chance to help the next one complete his quest, or maybe you won't. As it stands now, this is where your story ends."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleBadEndFollowup.BiggerThanLastTime": "You've gotten bigger since I saw you last. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleBadEndFollowup.CongratulateNewFamily": "[say: Really? Well I guess I should congratulate you on your new family,] the young champion says with a little uncertainty. [say: Oh, it's not really a new family,] the other responds as a pair of little girls that look very much like little Marbles come running out of the barn, one chasing the other. [say: Oh wow, you've found a nice family to join,] the younger champion says, watching the girls run off towards the farm house. [say: Were those twins?] [say: No,] the older champion responds, [say: Mili is several weeks older then Aura, but they're both my children.] The younger champion stares at him incredulously before stammering [say: But how? They're at least a few years old!] The older champion puts his arm around the younger one's shoulder and leads him and Marble inside the barn telling him. [say: You have a lot to learn about this world if you're going to last.] "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleBadEndFollowup.EyesLightUp": "His eyes light up as he spots a very attractive "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleBadEndFollowup.FemaleVoiceCallsOut": "At that moment, an earthly female voice calls out from inside the barn. [say: Sweetie, is that someone you know?] The older champion smiles and replies to the voice, [say: Yes Marble, it is. You should come out and meet him.] [say: Alright,] the voice calls back. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleBadEndFollowup.GladToHaveFriend": "[saystart]I'm so glad to have found a friend like you in this world, [name]. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleBadEndFollowup.HumanByBarnDoor": "{0} human leaning against one of the barn doors in a farm hand outfit. It looks like [he]'s taking a break from something. With a big smile on his face, the young champion strides up to [him] and says, [say: Hello there, it's rare to see a human in this world.] The other looks up at him for a few moments before smiling in recognition and saying [say: So they picked you to go after me, huh?] The young champion stared at the {1} for a few moments, unable to answer, this was better than he could have ever hoped for! He was looking at last year's champion, [name]![pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleBadEndFollowup.HumanityLeftBehind": "[saystart]You really are [name]! I can't believe you left your humanity behind, but I'm glad to have found a friend in this world. "
