  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.AsksWhatSheHears": "[pg]You ask her what she hears, and if the child is feeling as good as you are now."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.CannotBeUpset": "[pg]You point out that, given just how happy it makes the child's mother, they couldn't possibly be upset."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.CheckTheCalf": "[pg]She laughs. [say:Well sweetie, why don't you check on our calf to be sure?] She pats her belly again. Nodding, you move over to her and rest your head on the swell of her womb. You can hear the rapid beating of the child's pulse slow down to a steady rhythm and stay there, apparently content and sleeping. You say as much."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.CurlUpTogether": "[pg]That sounds like a good suggestion to you, and the two of you pull over some pillows and blankets, curling up together."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.DriftIntoSleep": "[pg]It isn't very long afterwards that you drift off to sleep with your arms wrapped around the content cow-girl, your softening [cockfit {0}] still inside her cream-filled womanhood."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.ListensToBaby": "The two of you spend some time simply lying there, trying to recover. Eventually Marble pulls herself off, severing the connection between your bodies, and rests her head on your swollen belly. She idly plays her fingers across your relaxed form while she listens to the sounds of the baby inside."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.NodInSilence": "[pg]You nod in agreement, neglecting to mention that you won't be able to go anywhere if Marble stays on top of you like that."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.PlayfulWink": "[pg][say:Well, in that case, we'd better get some sleep, eh sweetie?] She winks at you."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.PullUpBlankets": "[pg]You shake your head, and pull up a number of blankets and pillows to get comfortable. After a few minutes pass, you fall asleep with Marble's head pressed gently against the swell of your pregnancy."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.PullUpPillows": "[pg][say:Well then]--your mate pulls up some pillows and blankets--[say:maybe we should get some sleep too?] With a word of approval, you lean back down onto Marble's round belly, and drift off to the sound of your child's beating heart."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.RelaxedHeartbeat": "[pg]She chuckles, [say:Given how relaxed that heart is now, I don't think you need to worry sweetie. Our little one is sleeping contently now. Of course, I think I might want to keep an ear on them all night, if you don't mind.] She winks at you."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.RestAndRecover": "The two of you spend some time simply lying there, trying to recover. Eventually Marble chuckles and props herself up on an elbow, smiling while holding you in her gleaming brown eyes. [say:Well, I don't think I'll be able to move much after that, what about you?]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightEnd.RubsSwollenBelly": "The two of you spend some time simply lying there, trying to recover. Eventually Marble pulls herself off, severing the connection between your bodies, and sits down next to you. She idly rubs her swollen belly contentedly. [say:I'm sure this little one doesn't mind us enjoying each other like this.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightLovemaking.CradleHerBelly": "[pg]You smile and add your hands to her belly as well, feeling the growing child within. You agree that it would be bad for your child if the mother ended up frustrated and pent up."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightLovemaking.HintAtIntimacy": "You're sure that the two of you have more on your minds than sleep."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightLovemaking.NoPentUpNeeds": "[pg]You assure your lover that it wouldn't do to let her get pent up and frustrated."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightLovemaking.PatsPregnantBelly": "[pg][say:Oh yes, mama has some needs that have to be taken care of. This]--she pats her growing belly--[say:hasn't changed that in the least.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightLovemaking.StillHasNeeds": "[pg][say:I may be pure now, sweetie, but I still have needs to take care of.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightLovemaking.UsherHerInside": "[pg]By this time the two of you have reached your [cabin]. You usher your mate inside and follow her, letting the [if (builtcabin) {door swing|flap fall}] back into place with one last glance out on the barren landscape around the portal."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightLustEnd.GoodMorningKiss": "[pg][say:Hmm, good morning sweetie.] She leans over and presses her lips against yours. Her kisses trail lazily down your chin, fatigue still evident, but she wishes you well on your day."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightLustEnd.SoreButContent": "You awaken feeling a bit sore, but content. You and Marble have separated a bit in the night, but are still lying next to each other. You take a few deep breaths and stretch your arms. The movements cause a stir in your lover, and her eyes flutter open."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightMassage.HelpHerRelax": "[pg]Smiling at your lover, you decide to help her relax a bit after the day's rigors, working and rubbing at those stiff spots. Marble groans in approval at your efforts, no less so when you take care of her other arm. Of course, the real problem areas will be her shoulders and back, so you get her to turn over so you can massage the soreness out of her sinew."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightMassage.HiddenUnderFat": "[pg]It's amazing just what a cow-girl's body can hide under a layer of fat, but that only makes you find her that much more beautiful. Anyone who was watching your treatment would call it more of a body worship than a massage. Marble's certainly not getting more relaxed while you work away at her--her tail is flicking around more and more violently with each passing moment."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.MarbleNightMassage.MassageNotKiss": "[pg][say:Hmm, hey sweetie, I thought this was going to be a massage, not a full body kiss,] Marble notes, while barely suppressing a giggle. In response, you end your teasing for a moment to give a playful nibble on her squishy butt-cheek. [say:Oh! That wasn't very nice!] she mock complains, this time failing to stop herself from giggling. You return to removing her skirt, while also lathering on a few more kisses to her bum and legs before returning to her shoulders to give them a good rub."
