  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.CallOverToChat": "You call Marble over and the two of you sit down on some rocks to chat. After thinking a bit, you sort through everything that has happened in this strange land, trying to come up with a new story for your bovine friend. "
