  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.ForestCaveTale": "You tell Marble about the cave you found deep in the forest. For some reason, this seems to bother Marble, but when you ask her what is wrong, she claims it's just a feeling and tells you not to worry about it. Maybe you should make sure you're ready before you go back there?"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.FoundDemonFactory": "You tell Marble you found a demonic factory and relate everything you know about it. [say: Be careful in there,] Marble tells you, [say: I'm certain that place will consume you if you're unprepared.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.HappyHelpedMarae": "Marble is very happy to hear you helped Marae. With the factory taken care of and Marae's corruption postponed for some time, the both of you will probably sleep a little easier tonight. "
