  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.LethiceDefeated": "You tell Marble about how you've fought and defeated Lethice the Demon Queen. She looks at you and smiles. [say: You've done well, sweetie. You have managed to stop the corruption.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.LethiceStronghold": "You tell Marble about how you've found the stronghold where Lethice might reside. She looks at you with a worried look on her face. Marble admits that for some reason she felt like you were in great danger, but couldn't figure out why she felt that. [say: Be careful, sweetie. It looks like it might be very dangerous there. Who knows what might happen if you fall victim? All hope would be lost.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.LethiciteBreedQuestion": "You continue and tell her how your attempt to get Marae's lethicite turned out. Marble can't believe you tried that, but when she hears what happened next, her eyes go wide and she actually starts masturbating in front of you. At the end of your tale, Marble looks at you a bit nervously and asks, [say: So sweetie, does that mean you're going to breed with me?] Hmm, that might not be a bad idea."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.LethicitePregnancyConcern": "You continue and tell her how your attempt to get Marae's lethicite turned out. Marble can't believe you tried that, but when she hears what happened next, her eyes go wide and she actually starts masturbating in front of you. At the end of your tale, however, Marble looks more concerned than aroused. She hopes you won't have too much trouble with pregnancies. That seemed to have killed the mood for her, too."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.MainStoryDone": "[say: Sweetie, you've finished the main story of the game!] she says to you winking. [say: Why not explore? There's a lot in here that isn't a part of the main story. You could also try changing your form and see how that changes each encounter. Just don't get caught or lose your head, ok sweetie?]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.MainStoryWait": "[say: Sweetie, you've finished all that there is in the main story of the game so far. You'll have to wait for Fenoxo to add more,] she says to you winking. [say: In the meantime, explore! There's a lot in here that isn't a part of the main story. You could also try changing your form and see how that changes each encounter. Just don't get caught or lose your head, ok sweetie?]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.MarbleShakenStory": "Your story about what had happened to Marae seems to have shaken up Marble a little. Though, you notice that she seems to be getting more and more aroused as you relate your story. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.NextStepAdvice": "The topic of conversation turns to your mission and you ask Marble what she thinks you should be doing next. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.NoNewStories": "You have no new stories to share with Marble, so you chat for a bit about inconsequential things."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.NotReadyForMountains": "[say: I think we should help out Marae and shut down that factory she mentioned was in the mountains, but I don't think you're ready to go into the Mountains yet. They can be brutal - get a little more practice, and make sure you've got a good weapon.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.OldFoeCave": "You tell Marble about your run-in with an old foe in the forest cave. She tenses up at first, but the obvious fact that you've made it out of there alright relaxes her. Marble admits that for some reason she felt like you were in great danger, but couldn't figure out why she felt that. [say: Anyway, I'm glad that you managed to take care of your old nemesis... that map sounds interesting, too. Think it really leads to the demon lord's lair? It is a bit overwhelming, sweetie, to think that you might actually defeat the demon lord! Part of me wants to beg you not to go, but I know how driven you are, and I won't stop you from going to fulfill your mission. Just promise me that you'll make absolutely sure you're ready before you follow that map, okay?]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.PatrolUniforms": "[say: Well... I've seen patrols around the camp before. They were all wearing the same uniform, so maybe there's some kind of city or armed force out there? Come to think of it, one time I found some sand where they were standing when they moved on - I bet they're holed up in the desert somewhere!] she says with conviction."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.ProbablyForBest": "but concludes that what you did was probably for the best. At least you didn't fall for her trick. "
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.RanAwayTale": "You finish your tale by recounting how you ran away. She isn't really sure how to respond to your decision, but Marble does thank you for not leaving her behind and joining Marae."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.ReadyForFactory": "[say: I think we should help out Marae and shut down that factory she mentioned was in the mountains. I have no idea what will happen in there, though, so make sure you're as ready as you can be before you go.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.ReturnToMarae": "[say: You haven't gone back to Marae yet have you?] You shake your head. [say: Well then go see her! I'm sure she really wants to thank you.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.StopLethice": "[say: Well sweetie, this is it. Your mission has been to stop the demons, Lethice is their leader. Once you're ready, you need to go to their high mountain lair and take them down. Make sure you've finished everything else you want to do before you face Lethice, you won't get a second chance.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.TelAdreTale": "This time you've got quite a tale to tell Marble: the last free city in the world, Tel'Adre. She is quite enthralled by the tale of the many buildings and people who live in its confines, managing to hide away from the demons thanks to the mages in the great tower, but is somewhat saddened when you tell her about how empty much of the city was, and oddly confused about the guards you met at the entrance. In the end, she seems to decide to check it out on her own, although she doesn't say so openly."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TalkWithMarbleAtCamp.VisitGoddessMarae": "You tell Marble about your visit with the Goddess Marae. Marble is very interested in the story and listens closely to your every word. [say: To think that there is still a pure Goddess in this world...] she says in wonder afterward, [say: But what's happening to her is so sad. We should definitely help her if we can.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChange.CampNoteFromMarble": "[pg]<b>You find a note from Marble back at camp, letting you know that she has an item for you!</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChange.CravingEscapeUrge": "[pg]The euphoria from Marble's milk has faded, and you need more milk. It's almost impossible not to run straight back to her and beg her to let you drink from her breasts again.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChange.DesperateTremblingNeed": "[pg]Your hands start to tremble as you lose the only true relief you get to your cravings. You desperately want to go see Marble again, especially if it means a chance to drink her wonderful milk.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChange.EuphoriaFadeRealization": "[pg]You feel the euphoria from drinking Marble's milk fade from you. Only now that it's gone do you notice that it was actually making you tougher.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChange.MildEuphoriaLoss": "[pg]You feel a slight sense of loss as the euphoria from Marble's milk fades. You kinda want to drink more, but the desire is not overpowering.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChange.NurseryBuiltNotice": "[pg]<b>Marble lets you know that she's finished building a rather secure nursery for your coming offspring.</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChange.OverwhelmedMilkDesire": "[pg]You are overwhelmed with a desire for more of Marble's Milk.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChange.ShiverAndSuckleUrge": "[pg]You shiver slightly as the euphoria from Marble's milk fades. You really feel like suckling her breasts again.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChange.TremblingHandsWithdrawal": "[pg]Your hands develop a tiny tremble as the effects of Marble's fresh milk wear off. Thanks to the bottled milk you drank, you don't go into withdrawal just yet.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChange.WithdrawalSymptomsGone": "[pg]You no longer feel the symptoms of withdrawal.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChange.WithdrawalSymptomsGoneAgain": "[pg]You no longer feel the symptoms of withdrawal.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.CalmingDownTogether": "[pg]Marble looks horrified at your words and exclaims [say: You told me you would always want my milk! How could you do this to me?] You try to explain yourself to her, telling her how important your task is and how everyone is counting on you. As you speak, her expression slowly softens and eventually she calms down. [say: Alright,] she says, [say: I guess I shouldn't have worried about my milk so much. It's probably best if people don't drink it anyway.] You agree with her and she smiles at you. [say: I guess things are back to normal now.] You both laugh at this.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.ChestClutchApology": "Marble grabs you and pulls your head into her chest. [say: I'm so sorry sweetie, I never meant for this to happen,] she sobs above you. [say: I'll make this right, I'll make sure nothing else ever hurts you, even if I have to make you stay here with me.] An alarm rings in your head; how are you supposed to complete your mission like this? Marble feels you squirm, and speaks again. [say: I'm sorry, [name], but if you need my milk, this is really the best way... for both of us.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.ChillingClarityAwakening": "[pg]You wake up feeling like something has changed. With slightly chilling clarity, you realize that you have finally become completely and utterly dependent on Marble's milk; you must drink her milk every day, or you will die. There is nothing that can be done to change that at this point. You hurry over to the farm; you have to drink Marble's milk, NOW.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.ChoreMilkStayOffer": "[pg]A huge grin passes over Marble's face, [say: I'm glad to hear it sweetie,] she tells you, [say: I was hoping you might help me out with my chores. Then I'll see about getting you some milk.] The idea of working for her milk seems oddly right, and you put a huge effort into helping Marble with her chores. Afterwards, Marble gladly agrees to give you her milk. While you are nursing from her, she starts to talk: [say: Sweetie, I've been thinking. I think you should stay here with me from now on, since you need my milk to survive.] She starts to stroke your head. [say: You always do such a good job with the chores too; do you really want to do anything else?] You try to pull back from her and tell her about your quest, but she keeps your mouth from straying from her breast. [say: No, of course you don't,] she says with finality, and you feel your need to do anything else fade...[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.ColdStareAtNews": "[pg]Marble seems impassive at the news of hearing that you are no longer addicted. Her eyes have gone cold, her old passion gone. [say: Good,] she states simply and points at a paper on the table in her room. [say: That's for you. Goodbye.] With that, she turns and walks out the room. Since you are unsure how to react, you decide to take a look at the paper.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.CrudeHandwrittenThreat": "[pg]Underneath the entry is a single line, written in a crude and unsteady hand: <i>No one will ever drink my milk again. I'm sorry, sweetie.</i>"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.DailyMilkArrangement": "Marble's face falls at your words. [say: I'm so sorry; it's my fault for not being able to refuse you.] You shake your head and tell her it wasn't something either of you could stop. Despite what you said before, what happened happened. You two will just have to find a way to go on, regardless. She nods and holds out her arms. You gladly move forward and accept her milk. Once you've finished drinking, Marble looks at you and says, [say: I guess I'll see you tomorrow when you're thirsty again.] You nod and return to your camp.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.FaceFallsAtWords": "At your words, Marble's face falls completely. She looks up at you for a moment before saying [say: I'm so sorry; it's my fault for not being able to refuse you.] You hesitate, not sure how to reply to her. She sighs and invites you to her chest.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.ForgivenessAndSpecialAsk": "Marble's face falls at your words. [say: I'm so sorry; it's my fault for not being able to refuse you.] You shake your head and tell her it wasn't something either of you could stop. Despite what you said before, what happened happened. You care too much for her to let her feel bad about it, and you tell her you forgive her for the part she played in getting you addicted to her milk. She bursts into tears and hugs you tightly to her breasts, before letting you drink your morning milk. Afterwards she looks at you intently. [say: Can we do something special?] she asks you, suggestively. You agree without having to give it any thought.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.HerTalkFadesAway": "[pg]Marble continues talking for a while, but it doesn't really matter to you anymore, all that matters to you now is earning her milk, and doing anything to please her. Your mind is still able to wander freely, but it is so fixated on your need that you will remain at Marble's side for the rest of your life. Your village will just have to rely on the next champion."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.LeaveThingsAsIs": "[pg]A huge grin passes over Marble's face, [say: I'm glad to hear it sweetie,] she tells you, [say: Are you thirsty already?] You give an eager nod and she slips her top off, pushing your mouth to one of her teats. After you've drunk your fill, Marble sighs and gives you a smile. [say: I was thinking that maybe you should live with me from now on, but I think I like seeing you visit like this too much. It always makes me so happy to see you come by, so why don't we just leave things the way they are?] You agree with her and she says [say: I'll see you tomorrow when you're thirsty again.] You nod again and return to your camp.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.LikingHerForHer": "[pg]A huge grin passes over Marble's face, [say: I'm glad to hear it sweetie,] she tells you, [say: Are you thirsty already?] You give an eager nod and she slips her top off, pushing your mouth to one of her teats. After you've drunk your fill, you notice Marble staring closely at you. [say: Sweetie, do you like me for more than just my milk?] You are taken aback by the question, why wouldn't you? [say: I want to know if you like me because I'm me, and not because you like my milk. Can you show me in a special way?] she asks you, suggestively. You agree without having to think about it at all.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.LoversMenuNotice": "[b:(Marble has been added to the Lovers menu!)]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.MarbleSmilesInRoom": "You find Marble in her room. When you come in she looks up at you and smiles deeply. [say: What happened?] she asks, [say: Something about you feels so wonderful and right.] You explain to her that you've finally become entirely dependent on her milk.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.MilkPerkGained": "[pg](You gain the <b>Marble's Milk</b> perk. It boosts your strength and toughness, but requires that you drink Marble's Milk every day.)[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.ParagraphBreakAgain": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.ParagraphBreakThird": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.PleaWhileNursing": "As you're drinking from Marble's breasts, you hear her say [say: Don't you ever leave my side again, sweetie. I'll make it up to you for what happened.] As she says this an odd feeling passes through you. For a brief instant you panic as you realize that any thought not to do as Marble asks is vanishing from your mind. Then it passes, and without any doubt, you will be staying with Marble for the rest of your life. There will be no more adventuring for this year's champion.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.PulledIntoHerChest": "Marble grabs you and pulls your head into her chest. [say: Mmm, if you need me so much, then I want you to move in with me on the farm,] she says happily above you. [say: That way, I can take care of you and you can help me, and we'll both be happy.] You panic a bit; while you'd certainly be happy to have the source of her delicious milk at your fingertips, leaving the portal unguarded means the demons will be free to set up shop there again! Marble responds to your squirming by tightening her arms and says, [say: Ah, ah, remember, sweetie; you need my milk and I control whether or not you can drink it. I'm happy to share it, but if I'm being so generous, I think the least you could do is make it easier for me. I don't think living here and helping me with the farmwork is too much to ask, do you?] Her face contorts into an open-mouthed smile and her eyes glitter. You sigh into her chest, she's right, there isn't much you can do about it now..."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.ReassuredGoodFriend": "[pg]Marble looks relieved, like a great weight has been lifted from her shoulders. [say: I'm glad you won't need me anymore then,] she says, her face falling, [say: Now, no one will mind if I disappear.] You look at her in surprise and ask her why she says that. She explains that the only way to be sure that no one else ever drinks her milk is for her to disappear, forever. You tell her not to think like that and that the people on the farm still appreciate her help with the chores and duties, insisting that they would all be sorry to see her go. Besides, now that you both know that her milk is addictive, the two of you have a big advantage compared to what happened the first time. [say: Plus, we got through it, didn't we?] you say with a smile. At this, her face lights up, [say: You're right! Thanks for being such a good friend, sweetie.] She smiles at you in return. [say: I guess things are back to normal now.] You both laugh at this.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.ResistancePerkGained": "[pg]<b>You have gained the perk Marble Resistance</b> (You know how to avoid the addictive qualities of her milk!)[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.SheStormsOutLeaving": "[pg]Marble looks horrified at your words and exclaims, [say: You told me you would always want my milk! How could you do this to me?] You try to explain yourself to her, but she will have none of it. [say: That's it, I'm leaving, don't come looking for me.] She storms out the door. Having no further reason to stay here, you leave too.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.StartledMarbleGreeting": "You find Marble in her room. When you come in she looks up at you and starts. [say: What happened?] she asks, [say: Something about you is completely different from before...] You explain to her that you've gotten over your addiction and no longer crave her milk.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.StaysAtCampOffer": "[pg]Marble looks horrified at your words and exclaims [say: You told me you would always want my milk! How could you do this to me?] You try to explain yourself to her, telling her how important your task is and how everyone is counting on you. As you speak, her expression slowly softens and eventually she calms down. [say: Alright,] she says [say: I guess I shouldn't have worried about my milk so much. It's probably best if people don't drink it anyway.] You agree with her and she smiles, suddenly looking down. [say: Without someone like you, I don't think things would have turned out this way. I...] she hesitates, [say: I'll stay with you at camp from now on!][pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.StrangelyRestedAwakening": "[pg]You wake up feeling strangely at ease, having slept better than you have in a long while. After a minute, you realize that you don't feel a need to drink Marble's milk anymore! You are free of your addiction. You hurry off to the farm to give her the news.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.TearsAndTightHug": "[pg]Marble looks relieved, like a great weight has been lifted from her shoulders. [say: I'm glad you won't need me anymore then,] she says, her face falling, [say: Now, no one will mind if I disappear.] You look at her in surprise and quickly grab her arms. You tell her with no uncertainty that if she disappeared, you would forever miss her. You don't care about her milk, it doesn't matter; it is her as a person that matters to you. You wouldn't have done all those things or spent all that time together if you didn't care about her. She bursts into tears and hugs you tightly to her breasts.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TimeChangeLarge.TornEncyclopediaPage": "The piece of paper looks like a page torn from a book. It looks like an entry from an encyclopedia of sorts, and it reads in formal script:[pg]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TooManyCows.GargantuanFamily": "[pg]The gargantuan size of your family leaves her speechless. Unable to cope with the absurdity of you bringing so many kids to life and managing to fit them all in the streets, she turns around and leaves to get a drink at the Wet Bitch. Your children look at you in confusion, but you tell them it's all fine before you leave Tel'Adre."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TurnDownMarbleSexFirstTime.RefusalSinksIn": "She stares at you for a few moments as your refusal sinks in. [say: So you don't feel the same way about me... I'm sorry, I won't ever ask you again,] she says sadly. [say: Maybe I'll see you later.] She directs you out the door. You realize that refusing her will permanently affect your relationship."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TurnDownMarbleSexRepeat.DisappointedBrightening": "She looks disappointed at your refusal but quickly brightens up and says, [say: Ok sweetie, next time then.] On that note, you bid farewell to the pretty cow-girl and return to your camp."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.TurnOffMarbleForever.ConsideringHerBreasts": "Considering the way the cow-girl lovingly cradles her hefty breasts as if they were the only things in the world, you decide you'd rather not get involved with her right now. You inform her politely that Whitney must have been mistaken - there's nothing you can think to do that would help. [say: Oh,] she says, surprised... and also nonplussed when she sees your reaction to her swollen jugs. [say: Odd, but okay. I guess I'll just lie back down then while you show yourself out.]"
  "Scenes.Marblescene.WantMarbleAddiction.HesitationConfusion": "[pg][say: What's wrong, sweetie?] she asks, confused at your hesitation, [say: I thought you wanted to drink my milk?] You explain to her that you're trying, but you just can't bring yourself to. [say: I'm not stopping you sweetie, go ahead.] As if a floodgate had been opened, you rush forward and start guzzling down her breast milk once again."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.WantMarbleAddiction.PonderingResponse": "[pg]After you've finished, you pull back and look up at Marble. She takes a moment to think before saying slowly, [say: So you can't drink without my permission?] She smiles down at you, though you can't help but feel a little uncomfortable at this apparent power she has over you. You decide to excuse yourself and get up. As you go to the door, Marble calls out to you, [say: Sweetie, just come back whenever you get thirsty ok? I'm looking forward to seeing how you are.] She giggles softly as you go out the door, leaving you to wonder if you just made a big mistake."
  "Scenes.Marblescene.WantMarbleAddiction.WonderMilkPraise": "You smile and tell her that her milk is the most wonderful thing you've ever had. You'll always want to drink it and do not care if it's addictive. She gives a small smile before softly saying, [say: Are you sure, sweetie?] You nod eagerly and try to continue drinking... but you can't bring yourself to do it. You really want to drink from her, but your body doesn't seem to let you."
}
